"Failed to download attachment (%(id)s) from cloud: %(code)s - %(reason)s"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຄັດຕິດ (%(id)s) ຈາກຄລາວບໍ່ສຳເລັດ: %(code)s - %(reason)s"

#. module: cloud_storage
#: model:ir.model,name:cloud_storage.model_ir_http
